    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "Une créature endormie sous terre. On suppose qu’il s’agit d’une Ultra-Chimère et qu’elle serait venue d’un autre monde, il y a bien longtemps.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Reminiscent of the Ultra Beasts, this life-form, apparently asleep underground, is thought to have come from another world in ancient times.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "地下で　眠りに　ついていたようだ。 太古に　別世界から　やってきたと おもわれる　ＵＢらしき　生物。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "La lumière semble être sa source d’énergie. Une créature extrêmement agressive, capable d’émettre des rayons laser au moindre prétexte.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Light is apparently the source of its energy. It has an extraordinarily vicious disposition and is constantly firing off laser beams.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "光が　エネルギー源　らしい。 レーザー光を　ぶっ放しまくる 非常に　凶暴な　性質。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il semble souffrir dans sa recherche désespérée de lumière, sa source d’énergie. On pense qu’il vient d’un autre monde.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It looks somehow pained as it rages around in search of light, which serves as its energy. It’s apparently from another world.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "エネルギーとなる　光を　求めて 暴れる　姿は　どこか　苦しげ。 別の　世界の　存在　らしい。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "S’il ne dévore pas assez de lumière, sa source d’énergie, il accumule les impuretés. Il noircit et finit par ne plus pouvoir bouger.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Light is the source of its energy. If it isn’t devouring light, impurities build up in it and on it, and Necrozma darkens and stops moving.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "光が　エネルギー源。　光を 喰らわないで　いると　不純物が たまり　黒ずんで　動けなくなる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "La lumière est sa source d’énergie. Les impuretés que son corps a accumulées en dormant sous terre lui ont donné cette couleur noire.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It survives by absorbing light. After a long time spent slumbering underground, impurities accumulated within it, causing its body to darken.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "光を　エネルギーに　生きている。 地下で　眠っていたため　体内に 溜まった　不純物で　黒ずむ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Sa quête de lumière, sa source de vie, le rend violent. Il détruit tout sur son passage avec ses rayons laser.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It needs light to survive, and it goes on a rampage seeking it out. Its laser beams will cut anything to pieces.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "生きるために　光を　求めて 暴れまわる。　レーザー光線を 放ち　あらゆるものを　切り刻む。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
